  {
   "id": "t_cf25df0bf41c0a03d568",
   "sourceHash": "cf25df0bf41c0a03d5684ca8fcdbb21860f56658a0618b509f99574ddd5f8be9",
   "text": "Ananda Lahari Retreat Ananda – 喜悦 Lahari – 波浪",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Programme name 'Ananda Lahari Retreat' and the Sanskrit words kept verbatim as proper names; only the glosses (Happiness, Wave) translated."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a3e6e47b1a8d4e8b540d",
   "sourceHash": "a3e6e47b1a8d4e8b540d3570905c4c40838ee419b9df65f859ee0602a04a8274",
   "text": "在日常生活中，我们会遇到并处理各种各样的情况，无论是家庭、工作、人际关系还是其他责任。本方案旨在帮助您以喜悦和从容的心态应对生活及其中的种种境遇。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'This retreat' rendered as 本方案 (programme) for the clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fa7e7eee1e00978e07bc",
   "sourceHash": "fa7e7eee1e00978e07bcc29442840b21658c658ed86f6cdefb8155df55b5ed76",
   "text": "借助阿育吠陀以及瑜伽的教导与智慧，您将实现身与心之间的和谐与平衡，并与周围的人和环境和谐相处。这些历史悠久的传统提供了改善现代生活方式的途径，并为您提供一个框架，用以审视存在、充分体验生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b1489a8e7fde23434e2f",
   "sourceHash": "b1489a8e7fde23434e2f1b94b5a903e6b07e956ac25387736d56fcc96ceaa5d4",
   "text": "Ananda Lahari Retreat 为您提供在印度开启一段真诚而动人的灵性探索的机会，营造一个充满爱、光明与喜悦的境界。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Programme name kept verbatim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a0fed445750044706f06",
   "sourceHash": "a0fed445750044706f069c57dcc7ccd4f9904cdbf121074c4efe04ab6daafd1a",
   "text": "什么是 Ananda Lahari Retreat？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Programme name kept verbatim."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5da85a74d4f104bf2cc7",
   "sourceHash": "5da85a74d4f104bf2cc7f69af388e418bfc9d3a14a3a65520c18eb2c0311c491",
   "text": "我们正宗的全沉浸式方案为期 7 天，在喀拉拉邦风景秀美的 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 进行。在一周时间里，您将全身心体验瑜伽式生活：参加日出冥想和体式练习，参与吠檀多与哲学讨论，练习瑜伽休息术（yoga nidra），探索梵语与密续仪式，同时遵循阿育吠陀饮食，并接受每日按摩和治疗项目，从而将瑜伽生活方式充分融入您的生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c822702e84e7fe652aa4",
   "sourceHash": "c822702e84e7fe652aa4ce061db3095df494c254a58952a035939033a3d0f058",
   "text": "由小屋、花园长椅和插花组成的拼贴图。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aff0d211e31c1e26a288",
   "sourceHash": "aff0d211e31c1e26a28872a1d7af0d8538b376da186827022fd783c20168500f",
   "text": "我将体验到什么？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfacbc0babc7359db461",
   "sourceHash": "bfacbc0babc7359db461d6cef51b0f997c684dde8174a161435e254f7d0d6022",
   "text": "治疗师正在进行按摩。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b77ed1640aa68b56345e",
   "sourceHash": "b77ed1640aa68b56345ebb559790177d200d03cb2a611ff5860b75aaf70249b1",
   "text": "“Ayur”一词意为生命，“Veda”意为知识，因此阿育吠陀（Ayurveda）意为“关于生命之科学的知识”。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
